        "facts": ["Creon's decree denies burial to Polynices because he attacked the city.", "Antigone appeals to the unwritten laws of the gods that require burial.", "Haemon reports quiet public sympathy for Antigone and Tiresias says the gods are offended.", "A strong answer weighs Creon's case for civic order rather than dismissing it."],
        "misconceptions": ["Creon is simply an evil tyrant with no argument.", "Whatever conscience demands automatically overrides the law."] },
