      "The first mate Starbuck, a cautious Quaker, objects that seeking vengeance on a dumb brute that acted from blind instinct is madness and blasphemy, and that the owners sent them to hunt whales for oil. He even considers shooting Ahab but cannot bring himself to do it. Ahab refuses chances to help another captain search for his lost son.",
